Tsuchimikado Shintō was abolished in [[1870]] with the ban of [[Onmyōdō]], and only permitted again in [[1945]] with religious freedom and the abolition of [[State Shinto]].<ref name=":0" /> A new organization was created for it in [[1954]].<ref>{{Cite web |title=備忘録 天社土御門神道 本庁 |url=http://kashomemorandum.blog.fc2.com/blog-entry-137.html |access-date=2023-03-06 |website=kashomemorandum.blog.fc2.com}}</ref>
